{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-session-move#card-zh","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-session-move","commit":"941f0b64c59553ecaf1bce723a169dae03ed94b1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-move 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的工作区与会话管理插件。它在侧栏工作区树中加入可嵌套的虚拟文件夹，支持文件夹、工作区和会话的分组与拖动排序，并通过会话菜单和弹窗把会话移动到其他工作区。移动时会更新会话记录中的工作目录并重新挂载；打开但空闲的会话可登记为待办，在启动时重试。适合希望整理大量工作区和会话、调整会话工作目录的 DSH 用户。它使用 DSH 本地服务，不要求 API Key 或外部账号；需要支持定位会话文件的持久化后端。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1992-2006","lib/engine.js:510-610","lib/index.js:100-153"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-session-move#card-en","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-session-move","commit":"941f0b64c59553ecaf1bce723a169dae03ed94b1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-move adds nested virtual folders to the DSH web sidebar and lets users group or reorder workspaces and sessions. A picker moves sessions between workspaces by updating their recorded working directory; open idle sessions can be queued for startup. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1992-2006","lib/engine.js:510-610","lib/index.js:100-153"]}
