{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-session-move#feature-1","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-session-move","commit":"941f0b64c59553ecaf1bce723a169dae03ed94b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-move 的功能「跨工作区移动会话」：从会话菜单打开选择器，选已有工作区或输入目标目录。插件更新会话文件中的工作目录并重新挂载到目标工作区；正在运行的会话会被拒绝，无法释放的打开会话会记为待办。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1992-1997","lib/engine.js:510-610"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-session-move#feature-2","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-session-move","commit":"941f0b64c59553ecaf1bce723a169dae03ed94b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-move 的功能「嵌套文件夹分组」：在侧栏创建、重命名、移动或删除文件夹，并将工作区放进文件夹。文件夹状态保存在 DSH 数据目录旁的 storages/session-move-folders.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/folders.js:141-208","lib/folders.js:231-235"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-session-move#feature-3","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-session-move","commit":"941f0b64c59553ecaf1bce723a169dae03ed94b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-move 的功能「会话侧栏归组」：在移动弹窗中将会话放进文件夹或移出文件夹。此操作只改变侧栏分组引用，不会更改会话工作目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/folders.js:211-225"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-session-move#feature-4","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-session-move","commit":"941f0b64c59553ecaf1bce723a169dae03ed94b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-move 的功能「文件夹与工作区排序」：在侧栏拖动文件夹或工作区调整其顺序和父级；文件夹不可移入自身或其子文件夹。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/folders.js:181-195","lib/folders.js:198-208"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-session-move#caveat-1","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-session-move","commit":"941f0b64c59553ecaf1bce723a169dae03ed94b1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-move 使用前须知：会话迁移需要持久化后端能定位会话文件；README 标明目前只处理官方 JSONL 存储，其他后端不支持。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/engine.js:145-151","README.md:122-128"]}
